  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Bridge the gap between athletic heritage and relaxed leisure with the adidas Spezial. Taking cues from the brand archive, these slip on sneakers feature a premium suede upper paired with a metal trefoil pin for a touch of gold finish authenticity. The classic gum sole provides reliable grip and a cushioned feel for all-day urban adventures. Upgrade your rotation with this refined take on a terrace favorite.<br><ul><li>Premium suede upper provides a durable and high-quality look</li><li>Gold finish metal trefoil pin adds authentic archival detail</li><li>Slip on construction allows for quick and easy entry</li><li>Closed toe design with mid-vamp coverage for a secure fit</li><li>Gum rubber outsole ensures traction and a classic aesthetic</li></ul><br><b>Material & Care</b><br><ul><li>Suede upper</li><li>Rubber outsole</li></ul><br><b>Size & Fit</b><br><ul><li>Slip on loafer silhouette</li><li>Flat heel height</li></ul></p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas Handball Spezial Loafer - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Brown/Brown/Brown</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style